<title>UK: HORSE RACING-LORD GYLLENE WINS GRAND NATIONAL.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-LORD GYLLENE WINS GRAND NATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL, England 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lord Gyllene, ridden by Tony Dobbin, won the Aintree Grand National steeplechase on Monday.</p>
